WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:43,900
Don't pretend to be dead

2
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:46,060
The shot just now was to raise a figure

3
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,700
I'm very accurate with my marksmanship

4
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:49,540
Shopkeeper Tong Jitang is lax in his words

5
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,660
Pig food for 1,200 yuan

6
00:00:51,660 --> 00:00:54,300
You can't swallow the money alone, so hand it over

7
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,980
The old man left all the wolf skin and liver on his body

8
00:00:57,790 --> 00:00:58,990
My brothers only want money

9
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:00,350
You are obedient

10
00:01:00,630 --> 00:01:03,750
I'll leave you with a life, go back and don't come out again.

11
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:05,070
Beat it into mud and create a hole
